---
/**
 * Dark-only theme, per the ramose.ai brand guide: white on deep black, with
 * dark-forest panels and green as the one signal. Overrides Starlight's
 * ThemeProvider so no OS/localStorage preference can flip the site to a
 * light palette.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "dark";
</script>
